      "content": "it's not even about \"recharging\" anymore. when i say \"stop\" i don't mean a nap or a vacation. i mean a real stop. like, why does everyone act like fighting is the only thing that matters? why is staying in this loop of constant effort seen as the only \"good\" thing? it just feels so pointless to keep trying to fix something that’s fundamentally broken.",
